hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"433","[AI-translation] Yala bin Umayya (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umar bin Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke Allah Taala to farmata hai ke: Kuch gunah nahi agar tum qasr karo namaz mein agar tumhein khauf ho ke kafir log tumhein satayein ge, Surah Nisa: 101, aur ab to log aman mein ho gaye, yani ab qasr jaaiz hai ya nahi? To unhon ne kaha ke mujhe bhi yehi taajjub hua, jaisay tumhein taajjub hua to main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is baat ko poocha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye Allah ne tumhein sadqa diya hai to us ka sadqa qabool karo, yani baghair khauf ke bhi safar mein qasr karo. (Muslim: 2/143)"
"434","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Allah Taala ne tumharay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zubaan par hazar mein chaar rakatein muqarrar kein aur safar mein do aur khauf mein aik rakat. (Muslim: 3/143). Baab: Kin safar mein namaz qasr ho."
"435","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Madina mein Zohar ki chaar rakatein padhein aur main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath hi Zulhulaifa mein Asr ki do rakatein padhein. (Muslim: 2/144). Baab: Hajj mein namaz qasr karna."
"436","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Madina se Makka ko niklay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) do do rakat padhtay rahay yahan tak ke wapas lautay. Main ne poocha ke Makka mein kitnay din qayaam kiya? Unhon ne kaha ke das roz. Aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke ham Madina se Hajj ke liye, Makka ko, niklay. (Muslim: 2/145). Baab: Mina mein namaz qasr karna."
"437","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Mina mein musafir ki namaz padhi aur Abu Bakr o Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne bhi aur Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ne bhi aath baras tak, ya kaha ke chhe baras tak, musafir ki namaz hi padhi. Hafs, yani Ibn Aasim, ne kaha ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Mina mein do rakatein padhtay aur apne bichhonay par aa jatay to main ne kaha ke Ae mere chacha! Kaash aap farz ke baad do rakat aur padhtay? Yani sunnat. To unhon ne kaha ke agar mujhe aisa karna hota to main apne farz pooray karta. (Muslim). (Jahaf se murad chamray ki dhaalein hain; Faris se murad Habsha ka laqab hai.)"
"438","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko safar mein jaldi hoti to Zohar mein itni dair kartay ke Asr ka awwal waqt aa jata, phir donon ko jama kartay. Aur Maghrib mein dair kartay yahan tak ke jab shafaq doob jati to us ko Isha ke saath jama kartay. (Muslim: 2/151). Baab: Hazar mein do namazon ko jama karna."
"439","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Zohar aur Asr ko aur Maghrib aur Isha ko Madina mein baghair khauf aur barish ke jama kiya. Waki ki riwayat mein hai ke main ne Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye kyun kiya? Unhon ne kaha ke taake Aap ki ummat ko haraj na ho. Aur Abu Muawiya ki hadees mein hai ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se kaha gaya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kis irada se ye kiya to unhon ne kaha ke us irada se kiya ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ummat par takleef na ho. (Muslim: 2/152). Baab: Barish mein ghar mein namaz."
"440","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne namazi sardi, aandhi aur barish ki raat mein azaan di aur phir azaan ke aakhir mein keh diya ke apne gharon mein namaz padh lo, apne gharon mein namaz padh lo. Phir kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab safar mein sardi ki aur barish ki raat ho to muazzin ko ye kehnay ka hukm detay ke logon mein pukaar de ke apne khemon mein namaz padh lo. (Muslim: 2/147). Baab: Safar mein nafl chhorna."
"441","[AI-translation] Hafs bin Aasim ne kaha ke main Makka ki raah mein Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath tha to unhon ne hamein Zohar ki do rakatein padhayein phir aaye aur ham bhi un ke saath aaye yahan tak ke apne utarnay ki jagah pahunchay aur baith gaye aur ham bhi un ke saath baith gaye. Achanak un ki nigaah us taraf pari jahan namaz padhi thi, to kuch logon ko kharay dekha to poocha ke ye kya kar rahay hain? Main ne kaha ke sunnatein padh rahay hain. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe sunnat padhni hoti to main namaz hi poori padhta, yani farz pooray chaar rakat padhta. Phir kaha ke Ae bhatijay! Main safar mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sohbat mein raha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tahayat do rakat se zyada nahi padhein. Aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath raha to unhon ne bhi tahayat do rakat se zyada na padhein. Aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath raha to unhon ne bhi tahayat do se zyada na padhein. Aur Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath raha to unhon ne bhi tahayat do se zyada na padhein. Aur Allah Taala ne farmaya hai ke tumharay liye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki hayat-e-tayyaba uswa-e-hasana hai. (Muslim: 2/144)"
"442","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawaari par nafl padha kartay thay khwah us ka munh kisi taraf ho, ibtida mein sawaari qibla rukh ho to mustahsan hai. (Muslim: 2/150). Baab: Safar se aaye to masjid mein do rakat padhay."
"443","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik larai mein gaya aur mere oont ne dair lagayi aur thak gaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) mujh se pehle aaye aur main doosray din masjid mein pahuncha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko masjid ke darwazay par paya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum abhi aaye ho? Main ne kaha ke ji haan to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke oont ko chhor kar masjid mein jao aur do rakat ada karo. Phir main gaya aur do rakat padh kar aaya. (Muslim: 2/156). Baab: Namaz-e-khauf ke baaray mein."
"444","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki rifaqat mein Bani Juhaina ki aik qaum ke saath jihad kiya unhon ne hamaray saath bohat sakht larai ki. Phir jab ham Zohar padh chukay to mushrikon ne kaha ke kaash ham un par yak baargi hamla kartay to un ko kaat daaltay. Jibrail ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us ki khabar di aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se zikr kiya. Aur farmaya ke mushrikon ne, ye bhi, kaha ke un ki aik aur namaz aa rahi hai ke wo un ko aulad se bhi zyada azeez hai. Phir jab Asr ka waqt aaya to ham ne, aagay peechay, do safein baandh lein aur mushrik qibla ki taraf thay. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne takbeer-e-tehreema kahi aur ham sab ne bhi kahi, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ruku kiya to ham ne bhi ruku kiya, yani donon safein ruku tak shareek rahein, aur sajda Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aur pehli saf ke logon ne kiya phir jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur pehli saf khari ho gayi to doosri saf ne sajda kiya aur agli saf peechay aur pichli aagay ho gayi. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allahu Akbar kaha aur ham ne bhi kaha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ruku kiya to ham ne bhi ruku kiya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath saf-e-awwal ke logon ne sajda kiya aur doosri saf ke log waisay hi kharay rahay. Phir jab doosray bhi sajda kar chukay to sab baith gaye. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath sab ne salam phera. Abu Zubair ne kaha ke Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) ne aik aur baat bhi kahi ke jaisay aaj kal ye tumharay haakim namaz padhtay hain. (Muslim). (Iq-tita se murad tanha kar ke khatm karna hai.)"
"445","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daur mein sooraj girhan hua to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz mein kharay hue aur bohat dair tak qayaam kiya. Phir ruku kiya aur bohat lamba ruku kiya. Phir sar uthaya aur dair tak kharay rahay aur bohat qayaam kiya magar pehle qayaam se kam, phir ruku kiya aur lamba ruku kiya magar pehle ruku se kam, phir sajda kiya, ye aik rakat mein do ruku hue aur Imam Shafi ka yehi mazhab hai. Phir kharay hue aur dair tak qayaam kiya magar pehle qayaam se kam, phir ruku kiya aur lamba ruku kiya magar pehle ruku se kam, phir sar uthaya aur dair tak kharay rahay magar pehle qayaam se kam, phir ruku kiya aur lamba ruku kiya magar pehle ruku se kam, ye bhi do ruku hue. Phir sajda kiya aur farigh hue aur aaftab itnay mein khul gaya tha. Phir logon par khutba padha aur Allah Taala ki hamd o sana ki aur farmaya ke sooraj aur chaand Allah ki nishaniyon mein se hain aur unhein girhan kisi ki maut aur zindagi ki wajah se nahi lagta. Phir jab tum girhan dekho to Allah ki barayi bayan karo aur us se dua karo aur namaz padho aur khairaat karo. Ae ummat-e-Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Allah se barh kar koi ghairat wala nahi us baat mein ke us ka ghulam ya baandi zina karay. Ae ummat-e-Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Allah ki qasam! Jo main janta hun agar tum jantay hotay to bohat rotay aur thora hanstay. Sun lo! Kya main ne Allah ka hukm pahuncha nahi diya? (Muslim). Baab: Namaz-e-istisqa ke baaray mein. (Jabeinahoum se murad tanha aana hai.)"
"446","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab sooraj girhan hua to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne, do rakat namaz, aath ruku aur chaar sajdon ke saath namaz padhi. (Muslim: 3/34). (Ye hadees shaaz hai, sahih do ruku har rakat mein hain jaisa Aisha ki hadees mein hai.)"
"447","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zaid Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Eidgah ki taraf niklay aur pani ke liye dua maangi. Aur jab irada kiya ke dua karein to qibla ki taraf hue aur apni chaadar ko ulta. Aur aik doosri riwayat mein hai ke pas, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne, logon ki taraf peeth ki aur Allah se dua karnay lagay aur qibla ki taraf munh kiya aur chaadar ulti phir do rakat namaz padhi. (Muslim: 3/24)"
"448","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath thay ke ham par barish hui to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna kapra utaar diya yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par barish ka pani pahuncha. Ham ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Aap ne aisa kyun kiya? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke is liye ke ye abhi abhi apne parwardigaar ke paas se aayi hai. (Muslim: 3/26). Baab: Hawa aur badal dekh kar panah aur barish par khushi."
"449","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jab taiz aandhi aati to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ye dua padhtay: Ae Allah main us hawa ki behtari aur jo us ke andar hai, us ki behtari aur jo us mein bheja gaya hai us ki behtari maangta hun. Aur us ki burayi se aur jo us ke andar hai, us ki burayi se aur jo burayi us ke saath bheji gayi hai, burayi se panah maangta hun. Aur Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke jab aasmaan par badal aur bijli karakti to, khauf se, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka rang badal jata aur kabhi bahar niktay aur kabhi andar aatay aur kabhi aagay aatay aur kabhi peechay jatay. Phir agar barish barasnay lagti to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ghabrahat jati rehti. Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha ke main ne is baat ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke chehra-e-mubarak se pehchan liya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poocha, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Main darta hun ke kahin aisa na ho jaisay Aad ki qaum ne dekha ke: Aik baadal ka tukra hai jo un ke aagay aaya hai kehnay lagay ke ye baadal ham par barasnay wala hai, aur wo un par aanay wala azaab tha. (Muslim). (Takhyala se murad badal chhana hai; surriya se murad ghabrahat door hona hai.)"
"450","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mujhe, Allah ke hukm se, baad-e-saba, mashriq ki taraf ki hawa, se madad di gayi aur, qaum, Aad daboor, yani maghrib ki taraf ki hawa, se halaak ki gayi thi. (Muslim: 2/27). (Sahaab se murad ufaq mein phaila baadal hai.)"
